1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,000
Can I help you?

2
00:00:01,000 --> 00:00:03,197
Yes, I've just moved to this area

3
00:00:03,197 --> 00:00:05,380
with my wife and children

4
00:00:05,500 --> 00:00:10,100
and I'd like to know where we can all register with a doctor at a Health Centre.

5
00:00:10,100 --> 00:00:15,620
Okay. Well, there's Doctor Green at The Harvey Clinic.

6
00:00:15,620 --> 00:00:17,460
We always recommend her for babies

7
00:00:17,460 --> 00:00:20,540
because she's very good with them and she runs a special clinic.

8
00:00:20,540 --> 00:00:26,200
Oh... actually my youngest child is five, so that wouldn't be any good for us.

9
00:00:26,200 --> 00:00:27,380
Right.

10
00:00:27,380 --> 00:00:30,190
Is there anywhere else I could try?

11
00:00:30,190 --> 00:00:35,610
Yes, the Eshcol Health Practice is the next one on my list.

12
00:00:35,610 --> 00:00:36,790
How do you spell that?

13
00:00:36,790 --> 00:00:44,000
E-S-H-C-O-L. And it's Doctor Fuller, who has space on his list.

14
00:00:44,000 --> 00:00:48,240
The clinic only opened a year ago, so the facilities are all very modern.

15
00:00:48,240 --> 00:00:49,280
That sounds good.

16
00:00:49,280 --> 00:00:52,940
And it's particularly good if you're busy during the day

17
00:00:52,940 --> 00:00:55,840
because they also do appointments in the evening.

18
00:00:55,840 --> 00:00:57,950
They're closed on Saturday, though.

19
00:00:57,950 --> 00:01:02,320
The only other place on the list is the Health Centre on Shore Lane.

20
00:01:02,320 --> 00:01:09,680
You can register with Doctor Gormley, that's G-O-R-M-L-E-Y.

21
00:01:09,680 --> 00:01:13,220
He's new there, but the centre has a very good reputation.

22
00:01:13,220 --> 00:01:18,880
Oh yes, I think I know the road. That would be the best one. Thanks.

23
00:01:18,880 --> 00:01:22,390
Could you tell me, will all their services be free?

24
00:01:22,390 --> 00:01:27,240
Erm... there are usually some small charges that doctors make.

25
00:01:27,240 --> 00:01:30,880
Let me see what it says about the Shore Lane Centre.

26
00:01:30,880 --> 00:01:34,440
If you need to be vaccinated before any trips abroad

27
00:01:34,500 --> 00:01:36,040
you won't have to pay for this.

28
00:01:36,040 --> 00:01:42,889
Erm, what else? The sports injury treatment service operates on a paying basis,

29
00:01:42,889 --> 00:01:46,050
as does the nutritional therapy service.

30
00:01:46,050 --> 00:01:52,350
Some health centres do offer alternative therapies like homeopathy as part of their pay-to-use service.

31
00:01:52,350 --> 00:01:57,780
Shore Lane are hoping to do this soon. I think they may start with acupuncture.

32
00:01:57,780 --> 00:02:05,298
And finally, if you need to prove you're healthy or haven't had any serious injuries before a new employer will accept you,

33
00:02:05,298 --> 00:02:08,440
you can get a free fitness check-up there

34
00:02:08,800 --> 00:02:11,790
but you'd most likely have to pay for insurance medicals though.

35
00:02:11,790 --> 00:02:13,400
Okay, thanks.

36
00:02:13,400 --> 00:02:19,570
You might also be interested to know the Centre is running a pilot scheme of talks for patients.

37
00:02:19,570 --> 00:02:23,320
I've got the list here. Actually, they look very interesting.

38
00:02:23,320 --> 00:02:24,870
What sort of things?

39
00:02:24,870 --> 00:02:27,650
Well, the first one's about giving up smoking.

40
00:02:27,650 --> 00:02:34,350
It's next week, the twenty-fifth of February, at 7 pm, and that's in Room 4.

41
00:02:34,350 --> 00:02:41,140
It says, the talk will stress the health benefits particularly for people with asthma or heart disease.

42
00:02:41,140 --> 00:02:42,500
That sounds very interesting.

43
00:02:42,500 --> 00:02:45,557
There's also a talk for families with children.

44
00:02:45,557 --> 00:02:51,290
It's on Healthy Eating, and takes place on the first of March at five o'clock.

45
00:02:51,290 --> 00:02:52,790
Will that be at the Health Centre?

46
00:02:52,790 --> 00:02:56,607
Erm, actually it's at the primary school on Shore Lane.

47
00:02:56,607 --> 00:03:01,570
I imagine they're inviting the parents of pupils there. It says here 'all welcome.'

48
00:03:01,570 --> 00:03:04,260
Mmm, I might go to that if I have time.

49
00:03:04,260 --> 00:03:11,060
There's a couple of other talks-one giving advice about how to avoid injuries while doing exercise.

50
00:03:11,060 --> 00:03:13,440
It's on the ninth of March

51
00:03:14,020 --> 00:03:19,630
Oh, it's a late afternoon talk, at four thirty, and it'll be in Room 6.

52
00:03:19,630 --> 00:03:24,290
It also says the talk is suitable for all ages.

53
00:03:24,290 --> 00:03:28,950
And finally, there's a talk called 'Stress Management' which is...
